Job pipeline
------------

The producer, worker and progress logic in src/fse/models/base_s2v.py
(BaseSentence2VecModel._train_manager, _worker_loop, _job_producer and
_log_train_progress) was adapted in 2019 from BaseAny2VecModel in
gensim/models/base_any2vec.py (gensim 3.8). It has since been changed, among
other things to propagate errors, to stop all threads on failure and to pass
encoded jobs.

