Cython kernel
-------------

src/fse/models/average_inner.pyx follows the conventions of
gensim/models/word2vec_inner.pyx and gensim/models/fasttext_inner.pyx, such as
taking BLAS saxpy from scipy through its capsule pointer and preparing the
data while holding the GIL so the averaging can run without it.

