FastText ngram hashing
----------------------

_ft_hash and ft_ngram_hashes_into in src/fse/models/average_inner.pyx
reimplement compute_ngrams_bytes and ft_hash_bytes of
gensim/models/fasttext_inner.pyx (compared with gensim 4.4.0). gensim ported
them from Facebook's fastText (src/dictionary.cc,
https://github.com/facebookresearch/fastText), which is licensed under the
